This product bundles a binary distributed by the komari-monitor project:

  komari-agent  (the Komari monitoring agent daemon)
  Source:         https://github.com/komari-monitor/komari-agent
  Upstream release: 1.5.11
  License:        MIT
  Redistributed as: komari-agent-linux-amd64
                    cached on the flash device, installed as
                    /usr/local/sbin/komari-agent
                    inside unraid-plugin-komari-agent-<version>-x86_64-1.txz

The binary is redistributed unmodified. It is downloaded byte for byte from the
official GitHub Release asset

  https://github.com/komari-monitor/komari-agent/releases/download/1.5.11/komari-agent-linux-amd64

whose SHA256 is pinned in plugin/upstream.lock and verified against the
downloaded bytes at build time:

  78c28d89e523816baea010c0ed0714f245f508ffdaca0540f5c9f230f7053c8c  (12,585,218 bytes)

No modifications are made to the upstream binary.

